# Player car 2, second sheet. PDF page 16, block N.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip P6 7432
chip N7 7404
chip N6 74112
chip P5 7420
chip P4 74193
chip P3 74192   # preset 2: pin 1 alone on N999; 15/10/9 on the bus fed by the right-hand ground (fixed 2026-11-15, DR-1A 6A agrees). N4 on sheet 12 is 7
# Fixed 2026-11-05. Source sheet 14: N3.5 from P3.6 (NEC8), N3.6 from P3.2 (NEC7);
# M3.10 NEC9, M3.12 NEC6, M3.13 from P4.7 (NEC5). Death Race 7A/7B agree, and this
# now mirrors sheet 12. The old decode required BCD 13, which P3 never reaches.
chip N3 7402
chip M3 7420
chip N9 7404
chip M4 7420
chip L3 74193
chip K3 74193
chip K5 7421
# NTTA, NTTB, NTA1, NTA0, NTSR are P10 outputs with 6.8 capacitors.
chip P9 7404
chip P8 7432
chip P7 7408
chip P10 7404
chip M9 74112
chip M7 74112

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net NEGA P6.3 N7.9 P5.13
net 5TCBG P6.1 P6.5
net HGT3 P6.2
net NEGB P6.6 N6.2 N6.3 P5.4 P5.12
net 5HECC P6.4
net 5NEGA N7.8 P5.5
net 2PQ07 N6.1
net N999 N6.4 N6.15 P3.1 K3.15 M9.4 M7.4 M7.10 BOARD
net NEC1 N6.5 P5.9
net 5NEC1 N6.6 P5.1
net 6NQED P5.6 P4.4
net 1PQ07 P5.2 P5.10 M4.2 M4.12
net 6NQEU P5.8 P4.5
net 5ECDG P4.11 P3.11 L3.11 K3.11
net GND P4.14 P4.15 P4.1 P4.10 P4.9 P3.14 P3.15 P3.10 P3.9 L3.14 L3.15 L3.1 L3.10 L3.9 K3.14 K3.1 K3.10 K3.9
net NC P4.3 P4.2 P4.6 P3.13 P3.12 K3.13 K3.12 M9.6 M7.6 M7.7
net NEC5 P4.7 M3.13
net 5NECD P4.13 P3.4
net 5NECU P4.12 P3.5
net NEC6 P3.3 M3.12
net NEC7 P3.2 N3.6
net NEC8 P3.6 N3.5
net NEC9 P3.7 M3.10
net NECE N3.4 M3.9
net 5NECG M3.8 N9.13
net 1NECG N9.12
net NLGA P6.8 N7.5 M4.13
net HGT2 P6.9
net 5TLC9 P6.10 P6.12
net NLGB P6.11 M4.4 M4.9
net 5HLCC P6.13
net 5NLGA N7.6 M4.5
net 6NQLD M4.6 L3.4
net TGLC M4.1 M4.10
net 6NQLU M4.8 L3.5
net NLC1 L3.3
net NLC2 L3.2
net NLC3 L3.6
net NLC4 L3.7
net 5NLCD L3.13 K3.4
net 5NLCU L3.12 K3.5
net NLC5 K3.3 K5.13
net NLC6 K3.2 K5.12
net NLC7 K3.6 K5.10
net NLC8 K3.7 K5.9
net NLCG K5.8
net 5NTTA P9.10 P8.12
net NTTA P9.11 P7.10
net 5NTTB P9.12 P8.10
net NTTB P9.13 P7.12
net NTCR P8.8 P7.9
net NTNR P8.9 P7.8
net NTCL P8.11 P7.13
net NTNL P8.13 P7.11
net 5NTA1 P10.12 M9.2
net NTA1 P10.13 M9.3 BOARD
net 5NTA0 N7.2 M7.2
net NTA0 N7.1 M7.3 BOARD
net 5NTSR N7.4 M7.12
net NTSR N7.3 M7.11 BOARD
net 2ECK2 M9.1 M7.1
net 1NTA1 M9.5
net 1ESGC M9.15 M7.15 M7.14
net 1NTA0 M7.5
net 1ECK0 M7.13
net 1NTSR M7.9
